Handguns (Pistols)
Pistol: Baseline handgun (has Mk II version).
Combat Pistol: Reliable semi-automatic duty weapon.
AP Pistol: Fully automatic armor-piercing sidearm.
Stun Gun: Non-lethal taser that immobilizes targets.
Pistol .50: High-caliber, hard-hitting hand cannon.
