Submachine Guns & Machine Guns
Micro SMG: Fully automatic machine pistol usable while driving.
SMG: Balanced, controllable submachine gun (has Mk II version).
Assault SMG: High-capacity P90-style platform.
Gusenberg Sweeper: Historic "Tommy Gun" style drum-fed firearm.
