Assault Rifle: AK-style baseline platform (has Mk II version).
Carbine Rifle: Highly customizable M4-style gun (has Mk II version).
Advanced Rifle: Bullpup layout with a high rate of fire.
Special Carbine: G36-inspired all-rounder rifle (has Mk II version).
Bullpup Rifle: Compact rifle offering excellent maneuverability (has Mk II version).
