Tactical SMG: Compact tactical automatic platform

Shotguns
Pump Shotgun: Reliable, 
high-damage scattergun (has Mk II version).
Sawed-Off Shotgun: Compact, high-spread variant usable on motorcycles.
Assault Shotgun: Fully automatic, drum-fed room clearer.
